m940008.この地に眠る方こそ、ハイドース様の奥方その人。\n女神アダマスは、奥方の命を奪う:
The one sleeping in this land is Hydos's wife herself.
Adamas did not merely take her life;
here, she placed an eternal seal upon her soul.

m940008.言うべきことがあるなら、\n問うべきことがあるのなら、\nきっと今が、唯一の機会:
If there is something you should say,
if there is something you should ask,
isn't now the only chance you'll get?
